cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MOSAIC, please cite the following."
title: "MOSAIC: Specification-Curve Analysis of Spatial Transcriptomics Pipelines"
abstract: >-
  MOSAIC (Multiverse Of Spatial Analysis: Instability & Concordance) is a
  specification-curve analysis framework that quantifies how defensible
  analytical choices move biological conclusions in spatial transcriptomics,
  including spatial domains, spatially variable genes, and cell-cell
  communication, via a Spatial Stability Score (S3).
